# The model is a multi-hundred-MB binary fetched on demand, never committed.
# Run `xtask/fetch-model.sh` (or `cargo xtask fetch-model` once wired) to get it.
*.gguf

# Markers written by fetch-model.sh CHITTI_PURE (records that a GGUF was made
# uniformly quantized, so a re-run does not requantize it again).
*.gguf.pure
